 * Evidence-derived Script menu metadata from the GUTE52 GCPACK string pools.
 * A null label starts a mission group and names its live probe.  This limits
 * rows to a resident script family; it cannot recover the exact creator entry
 * or instance that the PC debug-menu implementation records at creation time.
 */
